00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:37.816
So, I'd say we were able to
develop a deep connection,

00:14:37.816 --> 00:14:40.604
sometimes deep friendships.

00:14:40.604 --> 00:14:45.556
I was able to help with
advice concerning academics,

00:14:45.556 --> 00:14:50.839
