reformatted a little bit, but

00:15:09.094 --> 00:15:13.901
it still remains, and
I think that the reformatting

00:15:13.901 --> 00:15:18.171
is going to position for
even greater expert.

00:15:18.171 --> 00:15:23.521
So that's actually great resource for
those coming from

00:15:23.521 --> 00:15:31.060
more different context to the GSB to
be able to tap into using to academics.

