00:16:04.625 --> 00:16:09.610
I also started,
don't know if I'm going to complete a PhD.

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:12.203
That was somewhere in Netherlands, and

00:16:12.203 --> 00:16:16.500
then I have a masters in Public Health,
