00:16:19.760 --> 00:16:25.269
So, yes, I do have quite
a few graduates experiences,

00:16:25.269 --> 00:16:28.208
some say its too much school.

00:16:28.208 --> 00:16:32.123
How Stanford and
the Business School compares to it,

00:16:32.123 --> 00:16:36.746
I'd say very briefly and
maybe this is recency bias speaking.

00:16:36.746 --> 00:16:41.961
But if I could go along
maybe some attributes,

00:16:41.961 --> 00:16:46.774
I'd say in terms of, one, inclusivity,

00:16:46.774 --> 00:16:52.390
I think that Stanford does
